    "sticky_notes": [
        {
            "id": "note_1",
            "text": "**What is a Lane?** A lane is a variable-length array of floats — Vivid's core data primitive. Even a single value is a lane of length 1. This graph uses three 8-element lanes to animate 8 circles on screen.",
            "x": -40.88671875,
            "y": 46.65234375,
            "width": 300.0,
            "height": 120.0,
            "color": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "note_2",
            "text": "**SpreadNoise → X positions** Generates 8 animated noise values used as X coordinates. Each element drifts independently, creating organic horizontal motion.",
            "x": -42.02734375,
            "y": 173.4609375,
            "width": 280.0,
            "height": 100.0,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_3",
            "text": "**SpreadNoise → Y positions** Same operator, different seed so Y motion is independent of X. Together they create 2D wandering.",
            "x": -42.8359375,
            "y": 281.1015625,
            "width": 280.0,
            "height": 80.0,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_4",
            "text": "**SpreadNoise → Radii** Smaller amplitude (0.06) keeps radii visible but subtle. The circles gently breathe as values animate.",
            "x": -42.37890625,
            "y": 367.609375,
            "width": 280.0,
            "height": 80.0,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_5",
            "text": "**3 lanes flow into Metaball** pos_x, pos_y, and radii each receive 8 values. Metaball draws one circle per element — element 0 gets (x[0], y[0], r[0]), and so on.",
            "x": 377.6796875,
            "y": 69.97265625,
            "width": 280.0,
            "height": 100.0,
            "color": 2
        },
        {
            "id": "note_6",
            "text": "**Circles + Rainbow mode** Each ball gets a unique hue from the Rainbow color mode. Try switching render_mode to Metaball to see the classic blobby look!",
            "x": 689.94140625,
            "y": 64.79296875,
            "width": 280.0,
            "height": 100.0,
            "color": 3
        }
    ]
